# Formal equivalence check template (combinational benchmarks).
# Variables substituted at runtime:
#   {GOLD_RTLIL}-- baseline Yosys RTLIL
#   {GATE_RTLIL}-- MyIR-pipeline RTLIL
#   {TOP}       -- top module name (Yosys-style, without leading backslash)
#
# EPFL combinational benchmarks have no flip-flops; equiv_simple
# alone constitutes a complete proof.  equiv_induct is intended
# for sequential designs with feedback and on multi-thousand-cell
# combinational adders it can take 15+ minutes without adding any
# new coverage, so we deliberately skip it here.

read_rtlil {GOLD_RTLIL}
rename {TOP} gold
design -stash gold

read_rtlil {GATE_RTLIL}
rename {TOP} gate
design -stash gate

design -copy-from gold -as gold gold
design -copy-from gate -as gate gate

equiv_make gold gate equiv
equiv_simple equiv
equiv_status -assert equiv
